# The `#` requests (#4276 c94 part 1): `#run use`, an unbraced
# `#run` call, name chain and literal, a braced `#run { … }` value, `#if`,
# `#loop` over declarations, a `<N: Int>` number parameter, a `#run` literal
# hook and a `#run { … }` statement region. main.jet prints the same lines on
# every tier as today.jet, the same program in the `comptime` spelling.
fixture: d_meta_spell1_forms.fixture
env: NO_COLOR=1
env: JET_STORE_DIR={work}/cache
env: JETPACK_ROOT={work}/jetpack
env: JETPACK_ENV=1
step o0: jet run --optimize=none main.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = d_meta_spell1_forms.stdout.expected
stderr: empty
step o1: jet run --optimize=basic main.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = d_meta_spell1_forms.stdout.expected
stderr: empty
step o2: jet run --optimize=full main.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = d_meta_spell1_forms.stdout.expected
stderr: empty
step today: jet run today.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = d_meta_spell1_forms.stdout.expected
stderr: empty
